          "date": "2026-11-11 10:50:28.000000000",
          "tz": -360
        },
        "subject": "LU-21184 lod: zero the whole EA when packing a layout",
        "message": "LU-21184 lod: zero the whole EA when packing a layout\n\nlod_generate_lovea() packs layouts into a per-thread buffer, which is\nreused by the next layout packed in the same thread, but it cleared\nonly the 32-byte header. A field that is not written for a component\nkeeps the bytes of an old layout: lcme_compr_type is written only for\na component with LOV_PATTERN_COMPRESS, so a DoM component can keep the\ncompression type of a compressed layout packed before. That value is\nstored on disk with the layout, and the next HSM release fails:\n\n  lod_verify_striping: compression is not supported on DoM components\n  mdt_hsm_release: cannot open orphan file: rc = -22\n\nClear the whole destination buffer instead of the header only, so\nevery byte of the packed EA is initialized.\n\nFixes: 47d6ce20cf (\"LU-10437 lod: clear layout header when generating layout\")\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Hongchao Zhang <hongchao@whamcloud.com>\nAssisted-by: Augment:DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash\nChange-Id: I5f39be9cda2ac138deaaa847e4edc17fc39fa2ff\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
